OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for new bar cafe in
OL,4,Aprominent city site
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bar and cafe chain is planning to
OL,7,Fopen up in one of Bradford's most
OL,8,Fprominent spaces.
OL,10,FUnit A in Centenary Square, a former
OL,11,Frestaurant and cafe, has been vacant
OL,12,Ffor years, only used occasionally as a
OL,13,Fpop-up space for events.
OL,15,FBut now national bar chain Loungers UK
OL,16,Fhas applied for a licence to open the
OL,17,Funit as an all-day bar and cafe, named
OL,18,FPanno Lounge.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
