OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for new bar cafe in
OL,4,Aprominent city site
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf approved, the new bar would be able
OL,7,Fto serve alcohol and food between 10:00
OL,8,Fand midnight. People have until 17
OL,9,FSeptember to comment on the licence
OL,10,Fapplication to the city council.
